					</strong>
					<p class="feature-benefit-full-bleed__text" data-font-size-pc="18" data-font-size-mo="12">Dodge, counter and engage faster than the rest. OLED technology delivers near instant reaction time with 0.03ms response time(GtG). HDMI 2.1 and DisplayPort connections keep you ahead of the competition with the 240Hz refresh rate. Milliseconds matter when you face the best.						
